# OpenMMT-8 screens: two-line LCD templates (16 + 16 characters) and the original unit's
# main loop pass per screen, in machine cycles: with a key held (7800 + held), with none
# (7500 + idle), and the pass that draws it over another screen (9000 + 32 * draw; 0 = the
# shown cells alone lengthen the pass). Measured on the original unit; screens shown only
# while running keep the defaults. tools/gen_screens.py turns this into build/core/screens.h.
#
# name      line 1              line 2              held idle draw
SELPART     " SELECT PART xx "  "                "    42   45   81
SELSONG     " SELECT SONG xx "  "                "    56   35   27
